    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "People often talk about what their ideal life would be like, especially students who have so much future ahead of them. Have you ever asked yourself what your ideal life would be like? If you have, do you "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " what an ideal life means?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", to live an ideal life means to do something you are interested in, something you would enjoy doing. But that’s not always a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " thing to do. I believe that if you want to have the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "spectacular",
            "ref": "v-spectacular"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "magnificent",
            "ref": "v-magnificent"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " ideal life you dream of, you need to work hard now. We all know that if a farmer wants to spend the winter "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", he must work hard during spring, summer and autumn. So, an ideal life can only be realized by rolling up our "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sleeves",
            "ref": "v-sleeve"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and getting to work."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As for me, I have "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " several ideal lives and I would like to share them with you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "My first ideal life is to be a programmer and use technology to benefit as many people as I can. When I was a child, I started to study programming. Several years later, I got quite a few "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in different programming competitions. At the age of 11, I fell in love with science and am still very curious about what I can learn. I always watch videos and read articles about science and technology to study and practice more. I hope this will help me make my ideal life "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the future."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The second is to study pandas. The panda is considered a national "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in our country. When I was little, my father showed me around the zoo. I liked the pandas best because they were lovely and cute. At the age of 12, I began to read books about pandas. The books showed me the wonderful movements pandas can do, such as rolling with their cute and fat bodies. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " scientists know much about them, I still think it is worth studying them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As spectacular as my ideal life could be, it might be difficult to realize. I think, though, that if you stay "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " achieving your ideal life, you might actually get there."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
